          "device": "Situational Irony",
          "definition": "A sharp contrast between expected outcome and actual reality.",
          "example": "Lencho calls the post office workers 'a bunch of crooks' after they anonymously donated their own money to help him.",
          "source_context": "Chapter 1 (jeff101.pdf)"
